OL,3,GNEWSAPolice trying to identify
OL,4,Apedestrian killed in Grangemouth crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are trying to establish the
OL,7,Fidentity of a man who died after being
OL,8,Fstruck by a car in Grangemouth.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at about 23:15 on
OL,11,FMonday on Newlands Road and involved a
OL,12,FFord Fiesta.
OL,14,FEmergency services attended but the man
OL,15,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FThe 35-year-old male driver of the car
OL,18,Fwas taken to hospital as a precaution
OL,19,Fand arrested in connection with the
OL,20,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
